\item[* copied from:] adapted from Dutch RVerbpattern2
\item[* modification:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
\end{enumerate}
\item[* task:] insertion of syncategorematic `it' for verbs that need one 
before a THATSENT
\item[\ \ strategy:] (also: deviations from accepted proposals)
